                        "glosses": [
                            "Arzt mit Allergien als Spezialgebiet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "168b70dc-8c79-4905-b528-d05207dfcf30",
                                "sense_id": "67efb8a6-bf9f-320f-a9a8-ccca799c2ca7",
                                "text": "Der Allergologe diagnostizierte eine Allergie gegen Gräser."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6ac9a6a2-02b0-4662-b8eb-39b423cd36ec",
                        "source_entry_id": "63dbd2e1-b168-3e5c-8023-5b354fed7f50",
                        "source_sense_id": "67efb8a6-bf9f-320f-a9a8-ccca799c2ca7",
                        "source_sense_description": "Arzt mit Allergien als Spezialgebiet",
                        "target_lang_word": "allergologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "allergologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2db157a9-1efe-386f-8b9b-bcd32e826bad",
                                        "entry_id": "a9c8c081-a6dd-3372-923b-e10856858b0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A scientist who studies allergology (the medicine of allergies)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad6dad03-ffa5-4c55-89cb-e77fe036d15d",
                                                "sense_id": "2db157a9-1efe-386f-8b9b-bcd32e826bad",
                                                "text": "To which the compatibilists replied, This is still totally artificial—choosing when to leap into an abyss or whether to turn left or right in a driving simulator tells us nothing about our free will in choosing between, say, becoming a nudist versus a Buddhist, or becoming an algologist versus an allergologist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1b7f8fc-a99c-30d3-a62c-6a1cfacf9ed9",
                                        "entry_id": "a9c8c081-a6dd-3372-923b-e10856858b0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An allergist (a physician specializing in the treatment of allergies)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0161dfa3-dbe2-4d26-a41b-b1bdfd8b3c44",
                        "source_entry_id": "63dbd2e1-b168-3e5c-8023-5b354fed7f50",
                        "source_sense_id": "67efb8a6-bf9f-320f-a9a8-ccca799c2ca7",
                        "source_sense_description": "Arzt mit Allergien als Spezialgebiet",
                        "target_lang_word": "allergist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "allergist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d8c9150-7562-3d94-9dcf-b6948872d475",
                                        "entry_id": "2fb2e20d-aebd-30ce-91b5-bc9bbd6612cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A doctor who specializes in the treatment of allergies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "beb7cfeb-e5d0-4b68-845e-441505e2c9b9",
                                                "sense_id": "6d8c9150-7562-3d94-9dcf-b6948872d475",
                                                "text": "As it warms up, expect everything to bloom at once, creating what allergists call a pollen vortex."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "847893c0-e42c-4518-b3e8-41187fcaaa9a",
                                                "sense_id": "6d8c9150-7562-3d94-9dcf-b6948872d475",
                                                "text": "Despite a rough beginning, this season might not continue to be so brutal, and the pollen vortex could soon become a distant memory. For now, pollen counts remain high, and people who want help with their symptoms should go see an allergist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "764df409-9145-4274-a125-009335373fa4",
                        "source_entry_id": "63dbd2e1-b168-3e5c-8023-5b354fed7f50",
                        "source_sense_id": "67efb8a6-bf9f-320f-a9a8-ccca799c2ca7",
                        "source_sense_description": "Arzt mit Allergien als Spezialgebiet",
                        "target_lang_word": "allergologue",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "allergologue",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "058d1f01-6fc9-32a3-bd39-dd7300c0907d",
                                        "entry_id": "6fdf130d-883e-3a8d-82a1-b106ce477b08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Médecin spécialiste des allergies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78193d68-7afc-4bab-8c57-9e107dd0cdcd",
                                                "sense_id": "058d1f01-6fc9-32a3-bd39-dd7300c0907d",
                                                "text": "En pratique, la transmission de ces renseignements à l’allergologue lui permettra de demander des examens de laboratoire appropriés."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c7b9bf4-0f89-45bc-a6b6-aa6065493c24",
                                                "sense_id": "058d1f01-6fc9-32a3-bd39-dd7300c0907d",
                                                "text": "Le sommeil, la sédentarité et la pollution de l’air sont les premiers sujets que l’Observatoire a choisi de traiter avec, respectivement, les interventions des professeurs Laurent Karila, psychiatre et addictologue, Grégory Ninot, spécialisé dans l’évaluation des interventions non médicamenteuses et Frédéric de Blay, pneumologue et allergologue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "198a4066-496e-4f2e-96d2-047a1761b8a6",
                                                "sense_id": "058d1f01-6fc9-32a3-bd39-dd7300c0907d",
                                                "text": "Elle est considérée comme un polluant bioologique tellement c’est un problème de santé publique dans les régions touchées, souligne le docteur Silcret-Grieu, allergologue."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aeff1a6f-83ba-48c1-bc9c-1fdc60ded3bf",
                        "source_entry_id": "63dbd2e1-b168-3e5c-8023-5b354fed7f50",
                        "source_sense_id": "67efb8a6-bf9f-320f-a9a8-ccca799c2ca7",
                        "source_sense_description": "Arzt mit Allergien als Spezialgebiet",
                        "target_lang_word": "allergologiste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "allergologiste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35c39902-4acb-3d6b-a8fe-c43442fd0065",
                                        "entry_id": "91a842d5-f9a5-3455-a99b-f642e8bc425b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Médecin spécialiste des allergies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9a8e823-0def-4310-96ff-6d48f5e20575",
                                                "sense_id": "35c39902-4acb-3d6b-a8fe-c43442fd0065",
                                                "text": "Il importe que le choix de l’allergène à éprouver soit fait avec discernement et que le savoir de l’allergologiste soit constamment mis au service de son discernement."
                                            }
